<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Jesus’ name we must declare</l><l>That we shall overcome the foe;</l><l>We draw authority from Him</l><l>The serpent’s head to crush below.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>No matter what, thou mountain high,</l><l>In heav’n or earth, where’er thou art,</l><l>At any cost we’ll level thee,</l><l>In Jesus’ name thou must depart!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Faith orders thee “Remove from here,</l><l>And be thou cast into the sea!”</l><l>We should, we must, we can, we will,</l><l>Fulfill God’s purpose faithfully.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
